  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/T4xFVm8kct\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/964608/description_88829ca5-d813-4ded-b021-30cf3a70da2c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"365\" height=\"104\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fatii1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/964608/description_5d0091c0-57d5-4bc5-8592-ca850b88254c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"359\" height=\"102\"></a><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308486/description_9a094285-8843-43a7-91fd-7131c5d03d7f.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"><br>此模組將 Minecraft 村莊徹底替換並全面翻新，變為基於中世紀建築風格的龐大城市與城鎮。全<em>部僅使用原版功能打造，代表&nbsp;</em><em>不包含任何自訂方塊或實體。&nbsp;</em><strong><br>（歡迎自由加入任何整合包）&nbsp;<br><br>推薦用於減輕延遲的模組：</strong><br>Enhanced Block Entities<br>ImmediatelyFast<br>Sodium<br>Entity Culling<br>FerriteCore<br>Chunky</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308486/description_a175c332-b1a6-4770-a551-0d55892bfc78.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"></p>\n<p><strong>近期更新：</strong><br>支援 1.21.11&nbsp;<br>改善生成機制&nbsp;<br>與為村莊新增建築的模組相容<br><br>🆕&nbsp;<strong>5 種原版村莊中已有 3 種完成：</strong><br>✅ 草原村莊<br>✅ 泰加林村莊<br>✅ 雪原村莊<br>🟧 稀樹草原村莊<br>🟧 沙漠村莊</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308486/description_9c6b75dd-54e6-4c40-8254-c1b2562948e8.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"></p>\n<p>進行中的模組列表：</p>\n<p>✅ Epic Villages<br>✅ Epic Witch huts<br>✅ Epic Dungeons<br>✅ Epic Igloos&nbsp;<br>🟨 Epic Jungle Temples</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308486/description_3af40383-8222-4dc8-9b26-ea8587d2054f.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"></p>\n<p><strong>- ✅ </strong>與幾乎所有地形生成模組完全相容<strong><br></strong><strong>- ✅&nbsp;</strong>與<strong> ChoiceTheorem's Overhauled Village<br></strong><strong>- ✅ </strong>與 <strong>Guard </strong><strong>Villagers&nbsp;</strong><br><strong>- ✅ </strong>與<strong>Waystones&nbsp;</strong><strong><br></strong><br>- <strong>🚧 與其他村莊重做模組搭配使用時可能會產生問題</strong><br><br><br></p>",
